      "trackName": "Soccer Game - Free Kick Watch",
      "description": "Free Kick for Watch is the only penalty and free kick game made for Watch!\nSwipe to curve the ball, bend it over or around the wall, and score the perfect goal. But watch out—wind can change the ball’s path, and defenders in the wall might suddenly start running!\n\nMinimal, fast, and intuitive, it’s perfect for quick matches—right on your wrist or iPhone.\nChallenge yourself and master the art of free kicks… anytime, anywhere!",
